f53d8cbcb36c1c27fa0431b9.png Hello, prospective wizards! 🧙‍♂️ For one week only, Ravenwood Academy: A Wizard101 Story is opening its doors for campus tours. Our free demo arrives during Steam Next Fest, October 19 to 26. Catch a glimpse of the academic adventures to come. All visitors are advised to keep their eyes, minds, and spellbooks open. 📚","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T21:00:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683088","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2853430-1840310314355030","game_id":"steam-2853430","kind":"announcement","title":"KingsIsle at gamescom 2026!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44972966/eb4a13247a11424b45dde8e0ad9f9849b40e48aa.png We’re excited to announce that KingsIsle will be at gamescom 2026 in Cologne, Germany! 🎮✨ We’d love for you to stop by, say hello, and see what we have in store. For more information, check out our latest post on the KingsIsle Blog! See Details >>","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T20:00:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314355030","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2853430-1837955055364358","game_id":"steam-2853430","kind":"announcement","title":"Cora's Curiosities!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44972966/26ac270a5167c5a3383986b86c808116efcde7f3.png Need class supplies? Used textbooks? Obscure magic zines from Wysteria? Cora's Curiosities is the place for you. Special discounts for students of Ravenwood Academy!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T20:00:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055364358","v